{{#with booking}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  We have processed the cancellation for your safari booking with <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong>.
  We are sorry to see this journey pause — and we want you to know our door (and our savannah) remains open whenever you are ready to replan.
</p>

<p class="section-label">Cancelled booking</p>
<div class="data-card">
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Booking reference</span>
    <span class="value">#{{booking_reference}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Safari / package</span>
    <span class="value">{{package_name}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Travel date</span>
    <span class="value">{{formatDate start_date}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Travellers</span>
    <span class="value">{{number_of_adults}} adult(s){{#if number_of_children}}, {{number_of_children}} child(ren){{/if}}</span>
  </div>
  {{#if total_price_usd}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Original total</span>
    <span class="value">${{formatPrice total_price_usd}} USD</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Status</span>
    <span class="value"><span class="badge badge-warning">Cancelled</span></span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>Need help with a refund or a new date?</strong><br>
  If a payment was already made, our team will follow up with the refund status according to the terms shared on your quote.
  If you did <em>not</em> request this cancellation, contact us immediately so we can investigate and protect your booking.
</div>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">WhatsApp support</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="mailto:info@tanzaniasafarimagic.com">Email info@tanzaniasafarimagic.com</a>
</div>

<p class="closing">Whenever you wish to return to Tanzania, we will be ready with warm hospitality and a carefully planned itinerary.</p>
{{/with}}
